{"ref":"BDB, לֵחַ","hw":"לֵחַ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">לֵחַ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. moisture, freshness</strong> (i. e. <em>force, vigour</em>);—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְלֹא נָס לֵחֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.7\">Dt 34:7</a> <em>and his freshness had not fled;</em> read <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלֵחָמוֹ</span> or <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלֵחוֹ</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלַחְמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.19\">Je 11:19</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בֵּית לֶ֫חֶם\" href=\"/BDB,_בֵּית לֶ֫חֶם\", dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</a> ad fin.; on <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:17\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.17\">Zp 1:17</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, לְחוּם\" href=\"/BDB,_לְחוּם\", dir=\"rtl\">לְחוּם</a>).","next":"BDB, לְחִי³","prev":"BDB, לַח²"}